rsonality and is skilled in sealing techniques',1,'kushinauzumaki.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(180,'Kakashi Hokage','kakashihokage',8,'UR',3,'Lightning',2705,276,271,277,1262,'1262|1228|1225|1171|1143|1035|1090|1036',3,2,3,4,1,'After the final battle, he became the sixth generation of the Hokage, and a few years later handed over the position of the seventh generation of the Hokage to Naruto',1,'kakashihokage.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(181,'Chojuro Mizukage','chojuromizukage',8,'UR',5,'Water',2690,266,262,272,1263,'1263|1007|1086|1135|1019|1106',4,1,2,3,1,'Successor to become the sixth generation of the Mizukage, during his tenure, maintained friendly diplomatic relations with various ninja villages',1,'chojuromizukage.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(182,'Prime Isshiki','primelsshiki',8,'UR',4,'Earth',2805,279,274,279,1264,'1264|1229|1228|1164|1042|1110|1145|1109',1,4,2,1,1,'After attempting to engrave Kaama on Kawaki again but failing, he died due to the depletion of his life',1,'primelsshiki.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(183,'Kakuzu 4 Heart Mode','kakuzu4heart',7,'SSS',5,'Water',2300,208,200,215,1265,'1265|1004|1012|1135|1145|1106',2,2,3,3,1,'A member of Akatsuki, a moneygrubber who seized 5 hearts to ensure he won\'t die but also suffer high blood pressure due to high heart rate.',1,'kakuzu4heart.png','SSS-Rank Shinobi'),(184,'Hidan Mode Jashin','hidan',8,'UR',1,'Fire',2715,256,267,271,1266,'1266|1004|1012|1086|1145|1108',3,1,2,1,1,'A member of Akatsuki, a super masochist, connecting himself to others with curses so that he can enjoy self-torture while seeing others die.',1,'hidan.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(185,'Kidomaru Cursed Mode','kidomarucursed',7,'SSS',2,'Wind',2080,218,210,215,1267,'1267|1015|1131|1143|1019',4,2,2,3,1,'A Sound Ninja who has become a spider man after eating too much KLone Food. His spider silks are used in the fight or the textile factory.',1,'kidomarucursed.png','SSS-Rank Shinobi'),(186,'Sakon & Ukon Cursed','sakonukoncursed',7,'SSS',1,'Fire',2158,210,211,215,1268,'1268|1016|1086|1099|1143',2,4,1,1,1,'Products of fused Sound Ninja brothers, occasionally separated or fused to have great fun.',1,'sakonukoncursed.png','SSS-Rank Shinobi'),(187,'Prime Hagoromo','primehagoromo',8,'UR',3,'Lightning',2800,279,274,277,1269,'1269|1227|1229|1184|1041|1110|1145|1109',3,3,3,1,1,'Young Hagoromo is the founder of ninja and the creator of all Ninjutsu',1,'primehagoromo.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(188,'Prime Kaguya','primekaguya',8,'UR',4,'Earth',2775,278,276,279,1271,'1271|1228|1227|1162|1012|1091|1137|1146',4,2,1,4,1,'The creator God of the world and the ancestor of chakra, has byakugan and rinnegan',1,'primekaguya.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(189,'T-Obito','whitemaskobito',8,'UR',1,'Fire',2760,273,270,275,1270,'1270|1012|1041|1036|1096|1033|1109|1148',2,1,1,1,1,'Wearing a white mask, he summons the corpses of six Jinchuuriki to fight for him',1,'whitemaskobito.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(190,'Ten Tails Obito','tentailsobito',8,'UR',5,'Water',2775,275,277,277,1272,'1272|1228|1012|1091|1137|1146|1132|1147',4,2,2,3,1,'Absorb the power of the Ten Tails into his body, and six paths of immortal fire chakras appear on his back',1,'tentailsobito.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(191,'Boruto Timeskip','borutotimeskip',8,'UR',2,'Wind',2750,279,274,278,1274,'1274|1230|1225|1156|1123|1039|1125|1100',3,2,1,2,1,'He is the eldest son of Uzumaki Naruto and Hyuga Hinata and belongs to team 7 together with Uchiha Sarada and Mitsuki',1,'borutotimeskip.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(192,'Byakugan Kaguya','byakugankaguya',8,'UR',4,'Earth',2800,275,278,278,1275,'1275|1271|1228|1227|1162|1091|1137|1146',4,2,1,4,1,'The creator God of the world and the ancestor of chakra, has byakugan and rinnegan',1,'byakugankaguya.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(193,'Kawaki Karma','kawakikarma',8,'UR',1,'Fire',2795,276,274,276,1276,'1276|1223|1158|1028|1091|1109|1110',2,1,4,4,1,'Originally the adopted son of Kara leader Jigen, he was later adopted by Naruto and called each other brothers with Boruto',1,'kawakikarma.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(194,'Mangekyou Sarada','mangekyousarada',8,'UR',3,'Lightning',2775,273,275,275,1277,'1277|1228|1224|1161|1132|1110|1035',2,1,3,4,1,'The daughter of Sasuke and Sakura, who usually wears glasses, belongs to team 7 together with Boruto and Mitsuki',1,'mangekyousarada.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(195,'Nagato Edo Tensei','nagatoedotensei',8,'UR',5,'Water',2764,268,275,274,1278,'1278|1012|1016|1034|1042|1096|1091',4,1,3,3,1,'Nominal boss of the Akatsuki, Jiraiya\'s disciple and actually a corpse controlled by Nagato with the Rinnegan, whose Six Paths technique is strong enough to instantly kill the entire Konoha.',1,'nagatoedotensei.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(196,'Sakumo Hatake','sakumohatake',8,'UR',2,'Wind',2740,268,271,273,1279,'1279|1227|1229|1184|1041|1110|1145|1109',2,4,2,1,1,'The genius ninja known as <Konoha White Fang> is powerful and his name resounds throughout various countries',1,'sakumohatake.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(197,'Might Duy','mightduy',8,'UR',1,'Fire',2750,273,270,272,1280,'1280|1223|1158|1028|1091|1109|1110',1,1,4,3,1,'He is both the father of Might Guy and Guy\'s mentor of faith enlightenment',1,'mightduy.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(198,'Himawari Timeskip','himawaritimeskip',8,'UR',2,'Wind',2770,277,271,276,1281,'1281|1228|1224|1161|1132|1110|1035',1,1,2,2,1,'Inheriting his mother\'s appearance and personality, he is very sensible despite his young age',1,'himawaritimeskip.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(199,'Fukasaku','fukasaku',8,'UR',5,'Water',2630,262,265,262,1282,'1282|1230|1225|1156|1123|1039|1125|1100',4,3,1,4,1,'Naruto\'s immortal master has been practicing immortal magic for over 800 years without feeling aging',1,'fukasaku.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(200,'Mamushi Shinju','mamushishinju',8,'UR',5,'Water',2770,271,278,275,1289,'1289|1218|1223|1158|1028|1091|1109|1110',3,1,4,2,1,'Led the Code to release Eida and Daemon from their slumber, and was sealed and cloned by Shinju.',1,'mamushishinju.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(201,'M