ichi Yamanaka. He is also the fifteenth head of the Akimichi clan.',1,'chozaakimichi.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(216,'Konan Angel','konanangel',8,'UR',3,'Lightning',2845,269,280,270,1325,'1325|1016|1131|1142|1019|1143',2,4,4,4,3,'The only gentle girl in Akatsuki, Jiraiya\'s disciple who likes Origami and always follows Nagato and Yahiko.',0,'konanangel.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(217,'Mitsuki Timeskip','mitsukitimeskip',8,'UR',5,'Water',2845,269,280,270,1326,'1326|1227|1225|1163|1024|1147',2,4,1,2,1,'One of the man-made people made by Orochimaru, who is generally treated by Orochimaru as his own children.',0,'mitsukitimeskip.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(218,'Pain Tendo','paintendo',8,'UR',2,'Wind',2845,269,280,270,1327,'1327|1016|1034|1042|1096|1091',4,1,3,3,3,'Nominal boss of the Akatsuki, Jiraiya\'s disciple and actually a corpse controlled by Nagato with the Rinnegan, whose Six Paths technique is strong enough to instantly kill the entire Hidden Leaf Village.',0,'paintendo.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(219,'Prime Sakura','primesakura',8,'UR',5,'Water',2845,269,280,270,1328,'1328|1224|1229|1186|1123|1039|1125',2,4,4,1,1,'Marks spread all over the body, and the instant she is injured, she will continue to recover at high speed.',0,'primesakura.png','UR-Rank Shinobi'),(220,'Tobirama Edo Tensei','tobiramaedotensei',8,'UR',5,'Water',2845,269,280,270,1329,'1329|1087|1043|1025|1012|1035|1034',4,4,2,1,1,'The 2nd Hokage, steady, sophisticated, cruel and restrained. He has tough political tactics and often manages his simple elder brother. He looks like an adviser but actually a housekeeper.',0,'tobiramaedotensei.png','UR-Rank Shinobi');

